{"parse": {"title": "ASD-08", "pageid": 55181, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/ASD-07\" title=\"ASD-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">ASD-08</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">ASD</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">08</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.BB.93.E5.B1.80\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"结局\">结局</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 结局</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\"></div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"></div></div>\n<p>本章为结局章，根据玩家选择，能达成以下四个不同结局。点击结局里的播放按钮进入相应剧情。\n</p>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap; gap:0 16px\">\n<table class=\"wikitable mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"width: 400px; max-width: 100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>于此如愿以偿\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"position: relative;\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/ASD-08a\" title=\"ASD-08a\"><img alt=\"Rouge review chapter 08.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/e/e4/Rouge_review_chapter_08.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"393\" height=\"199\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"393\" data-file-height=\"199\" /></a>\n<div style=\"position: absolute; right: 15%; bottom: 10%; text-align: right; width: 300px;\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size: 130%;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: bottom;\"><b>于此如愿以偿</b></span><span style=\"user-select:none; padding-left:0\">&#160;</span><a href=\"/wiki/ASD-08a\" title=\"ASD-08a\"><img alt=\"Btn play.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/24px-Btn_play.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"drop-shadow-lg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/36px-Btn_play.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/48px-Btn_play.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"96\" data-file-height=\"96\" /></a></div></div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"font-size: 90%;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 0.5em 1em;\"><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>达成条件：</b></span>在小教堂面对罗蕾莱选择「触碰」。\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"width: 400px; max-width: 100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>黄昏终了之歌\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"position: relative;\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/ASD-08b\" title=\"ASD-08b\"><img alt=\"Rouge review chapter 09.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/0/08/Rouge_review_chapter_09.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"393\" height=\"202\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"393\" data-file-height=\"202\" /></a>\n<div style=\"position: absolute; right: 15%; bottom: 10%; text-align: right; width: 300px;\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size: 130%;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: bottom;\"><b>黄昏终了之歌</b></span><span style=\"user-select:none; padding-left:0\">&#160;</span><a href=\"/wiki/ASD-08b\" title=\"ASD-08b\"><img alt=\"Btn play.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/24px-Btn_play.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"drop-shadow-lg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/36px-Btn_play.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/48px-Btn_play.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"96\" data-file-height=\"96\" /></a></div></div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"font-size: 90%;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 0.5em 1em;\"><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>达成条件：</b></span>完成一个特殊的委托，获得造物「悠远器皿」后，在小教堂面对罗蕾莱选择「握住」。\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"width: 400px; max-width: 100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>至此趋于完满\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"position: relative;\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/ASD-08c\" title=\"ASD-08c\"><img alt=\"Rouge review chapter 10.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/96/Rouge_review_chapter_10.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"393\" height=\"202\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"393\" data-file-height=\"202\" /></a>\n<div style=\"position: absolute; right: 15%; bottom: 10%; text-align: right; width: 300px;\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size: 130%;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: bottom;\"><b>至此趋于完满</b></span><span style=\"user-select:none; padding-left:0\">&#160;</span><a href=\"/wiki/ASD-08c\" title=\"ASD-08c\"><img alt=\"Btn play.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/24px-Btn_play.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"drop-shadow-lg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/36px-Btn_play.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/48px-Btn_play.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"96\" data-file-height=\"96\" /></a></div></div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"font-size: 90%;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 0.5em 1em;\"><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>达成条件：</b></span>要求达成过「于此如愿以偿」。完成事件「“致意亚琛”」，获得造物「“致意亚琛”」后，在小教堂面对瓦伦缇娜选择「握住瓦伦缇娜的手」。\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"width: 400px; max-width: 100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>感性满溢而出\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"position: relative;\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/ASD-08d\" title=\"ASD-08d\"><img alt=\"Rouge review chapter 11.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/c/c4/Rouge_review_chapter_11.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"393\" height=\"202\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"393\" data-file-height=\"202\" /></a>\n<div style=\"position: absolute; right: 15%; bottom: 10%; text-align: right; width: 300px;\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size: 130%;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: bottom;\"><b>感性满溢而出</b></span><span style=\"user-select:none; padding-left:0\">&#160;</span><a href=\"/wiki/ASD-08d\" title=\"ASD-08d\"><img alt=\"Btn play.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/24px-Btn_play.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"drop-shadow-lg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/36px-Btn_play.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/48px-Btn_play.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"96\" data-file-height=\"96\" /></a></div></div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"font-size: 90%;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 0.5em 1em;\"><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>达成条件：</b></span>要求达成过「于此如愿以偿」。完成事件「发狂的贵族」，获得造物「小螺号」后，在小教堂面对瓦伦缇娜选择「与两人同行」。\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "ASD-08"}}